\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.2}{\ignorespaces \xpg@aux {}{english}\ignorespaces The statistical path induced by a tokenizer. The encoder maps the reference distribution over character strings to a distribution over token sequences; the language model estimates the token-level distribution; and the decoder maps that estimate back to character space. Consistency with the original distribution requires the encoder--decoder composition to preserve \(p^*\), as established by \blx@tocontentsinit {0}\textcite {gastaldi2025foundations}.}}{12}{figure.2.2}\protected@file@percent }
